Third-party material
================================================================================

Embedded or adapted in this repository
--------------------------------------

* Android key layout data — scripts/waydroid-setup.sh, the
  Vendor_28de_Product_11ff.kl heredoc. Based on AOSP's key layout
  Vendor_045e_Product_028e.kl (Xbox 360 mapping).
      Copyright (C) The Android Open Source Project
      Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
      https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

* Gamepad uevent-retrigger — scripts/waydroid-setup.sh, the
  /etc/waydroid-fix-controllers helper. Pattern adapted from Bazzite.
      Copyright (C) Universal Blue Organization (ublue-os/bazzite)
      Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

* Binder module patch — scripts/binder-anbox-7.2.patch. A patch against
  choff/anbox-modules (binder/) for kernels 6.19+/7.x; its binderfs dentry
  handling is adapted from Linux drivers/android/binderfs.c (6.19+).
      Derived from GPL-2.0-only code (Linux kernel, choff/anbox-modules), so
      this patch file is licensed under GPL-2.0-only, not GPL-3.0.

* Game Mode cage launcher — scripts/waydroid-gamemode.sh. Reimplements the
  nested-compositor method also used by ryanrudolfoba/SteamOS-Waydroid-Installer
  (GPL-3.0) and Bazzite (Apache-2.0).

Runtime dependencies (NOT bundled — fetched or invoked on the user's machine,
and covered by their own licenses)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

* Waydroid — GPL-3.0-or-later — https://github.com/waydroid/waydroid
* casualsnek/waydroid_script — GPL-3.0 — cloned at install time to add
  libhoudini / libndk ARM translation
* choff/anbox-modules — GPL-2.0-only — source downloaded at install time to
  build the binder_linux kernel module (only when the kernel has no binder)
* Valve linux-neptune-*-headers — GPL-2.0-only — downloaded at install time
  from Valve's package repos to build that module
* Nix — LGPL-2.1 ; nixpkgs, Home Manager — MIT
* libhoudini (Intel) and libndk_translation (Google) — proprietary; downloaded
  at install time by waydroid_script, never redistributed in this repository
